cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "HOA: Humanfia Olympiad Agents"
abstract: >-
  Olympiad and benchmark problems solved by agents running on Humanize, with
  the answers machine-checked in Lean 4 wherever the subject allows it:
  PutnamBench, IMO 2026, IOI 2026, IPhO 2026, IChO 2026, IBO 2024, quantum
  information theory and quantum algorithms, and the Chemlib library.
authors:
  - name: Humanfia
    website: "https://humanfia.ai/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/humanfia/hoa-qed"
url: "https://humanfia.ai/projects/hoa"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - lean4
  - mathlib
  - formal-verification
  - olympiad
  - ai-agents
  - putnambench
